==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A super easy stage for most players. Use meatshields to stall the Festive Otters and ranged attackers to deal with the rest.

==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Citronella oil|Citronella oil]] is a fragrant natural oil most relevantly used as an insect repellent, which is mentioned in Citronella Scent's Japanese name.

